{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"他最舍不得被当自己人的日子，可回去还能像从前那样吗？\",\"source\":\"他慢慢觉得自己最舍不得的，还是从前有人把他当作自己人的日子；可就算真的回去，还能像从前那样吗？\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿写的是他逐渐形成的主观判断，屏幕稿删去“慢慢觉得”，把尚在形成的认识写成了确定结论。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"这回他不逼自己选边了；当初那些气不该忍，和那些人在一起也确实开心过\",\"source\":\"他想，当初那些气不该忍，和那些人在一起也确实开心过，这回他不逼自己选边了。\",\"type\":7,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先呈现对过去两面的认识，再落到不逼自己选边；屏幕稿调换了结论与前提的出现顺序。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78129cea-9bd0-44fc-b586-7a2274415b65", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T223810671012Z", "elapsed_seconds": 301.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:43:11.990842+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5924db133ac3306cff0f99d738fd42962bd9c99290372b7904879a8ad5f4c25c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we